<article class="env-lemma" id="01UF">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01UF">Lemma <span data-tag="01UF">29.31.11</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to S$ be a morphism of schemes. If $f$ is flat, locally of finite presentation, and all fibres $X_ s$ are local complete intersections, then $f$ is syntomic. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Clear from Lemmas <a href="/tag/01UG" data-tag="01UG">29.31.9</a> and <a href="/tag/01UE" data-tag="01UE">29.31.10</a> and the isomorphisms of local rings $ \mathcal{O}_{X, x}/\mathfrak m_ s \mathcal{O}_{X, x} \cong \mathcal{O}_{X_ s, x} $. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>